<title>JAPAN: Nippon Flour - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Flour - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 79.18		vs	   74.25</p>
<p> Operating	  600    million	  vs	  458    million</p>
<p> Current		1.11		vs	    3.57</p>
<p> Net		    1.42		vs	    1.83</p>
<p> EPS		    7.64 yen	  vs	   10.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    188 million	  vs	 183 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Flour Mills Co Ltd is a large flour miller.</p>
</text>
